# PC card team-gunline (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 10.4, TMODE-19): arm mglw (TMODE-19 heavier and wider, ablation tmgunlinew: 1.0, 100 px), all 46 teams against master (the aa build). Template: gnprep writes work/team-gunline-mglw.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
6
--seed-base
4500
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
team-census46.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@mglw.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@mglw
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-gunline-@V@-mglw
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-gunline-mglw.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
